**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**
A clear and concise description of what the problem is. Ex. I always have to tab back to my PC when [...]

**Describe the solution you'd like**
A clear and concise description of what you want to happen. If this involves a new or changed slash command, include what the command and its options should look like, e.g. `/obs mute source:<name>`.

**Which part of the bot would this affect?**
- [ ] `/obs` commands (OBS control)
- [ ] Twitch integration (chat bridge, subscriber sync, category/title)
- [ ] Discord moderation (`/delete`, role gating, logging)
- [ ] Voice/audio (`/obsjoin`)
- [ ] Something new

**Describe alternatives you've considered**
A clear and concise description of any alternative solutions or workarounds you've tried.

**Additional context**
Add any other context or screenshots about the feature request here.
